{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792130820, "covers_from": "2026-10-16T06:07:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-16T06:08:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792130880, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-16T06:07:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22123, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "我家的老房子有40年了，位於菜市場內，防火巷又窄，維修困難。沒有都更的機會嗎？", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.22,123", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T06:07:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26314, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "食安", "content": "小孩說學校的營養午餐很難吃，是否可以補助真正需要的族群，讓學校的營養午餐可以自費吃好一點的", "display_name": "松山代表 No.26,314", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T06:07:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 448, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "一下午後雷陣雨就到處積水，馬路上大小不一的凹陷處都變成水窪，過馬路一不注意就會踩到而受傷或被濺濕", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.448", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T06:07:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13600, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "忠孝橋上班時間太壅塞了！", "display_name": "大同代表 No.13,600", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T06:07:46+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23741, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "市容非常重要，早上 上班時走到街上，能給一股正面能量迎接新的一天的到來", "display_name": "大安代表 No.23,741", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 26314, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.26,314", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 448, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.448", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": tru